Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So, what do you think?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.44,0:00:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你觉得如何
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:12.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}New haircut? Necklace? Dress?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.28,0:00:12.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}新发型  项链  裙子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:15.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Boots? Boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.27,0:00:15.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}靴子  靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:20.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Now, they're a little more than I usually spend on boots. Or rent.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.14,0:00:20.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}比我平常买的靴子贵一点  也比租的贵
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:23.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.03,0:00:23.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我的天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.18,0:00:24.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:26.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'll miss being able to afford food.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.76,0:00:26.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会怀念温饱的日子
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. They just looked so good.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:27.85,0:00:30.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  它们真的很漂亮
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The saleswoman was looking at me like:
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.42,0:00:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}专柜小姐的表情像是在说
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:33.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"These are too expensive for you."
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.01,0:00:33.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"这些靴子大贵了  你买不起"
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She had a point.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.60,0:00:35.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很有道理
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.93,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, Monica, those boots are amazing.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.23,0:00:43.93,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}莫妮卡  这双靴子好漂亮哦
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're mine!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.93,0:00:45.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是我的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:48.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Too bad we're gonna have to return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.36,0:00:48.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}很遗憾我们得退回去
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:51.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Return them? They're gonna hear you.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.47,0:00:51.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}退回去  靴子听得见你说话
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:53.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I'm not returning them.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.48,0:00:53.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  我不会去退货的
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know they cost a lot, but I'll wear them all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.88,0:00:56.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道价格很贵  但我会经常穿
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:00.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You'll see. Besides, I love the compliments.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.82,0:01:00.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会看到的  而且我喜欢听到赞美
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:04.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Have you ever had something so beautiful, everyone wants it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.11,0:01:04.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你曾经拥有过美到大家都想拥有的东西吗
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I have you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:04.04,0:01:05.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我拥有你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:07.77,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Nice try. I'm keeping the boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.77,0:01:07.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}说得好  这靴子我留定了
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.99,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Friends S08E10 The One With Monica's Boots
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.91,0:01:10.99,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}《老友记》  第八季 第10集  莫妮卡的皮靴
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:50.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's right. I love you.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:47.91,0:01:50.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}没错  我爱你
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:54.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And I'm gonna play with you all the time.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:51.01,0:01:54.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我会一直跟你玩
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}How can you let him talk to your crotch like that?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:55.36,0:01:58.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你怎么能让他对着你的胯下说话
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:05.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} He's talking to the baby.  Oh! Okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:05.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他是在跟宝宝说话  原来如此
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:08.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, because when he said,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.48,0:02:08.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  因为当他说
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.54,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"I can't wait for your first words"...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:08.96,0:02:10.54,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"我等不及要听到你说第一句话"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...I thought, "There's a trick."
Dialogue: 0,0:02:10.54,0:02:12.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想"这招不错"
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:18.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I gotta go, you guys. I'll see you later.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.41,0:02:18.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我得走了  待会见
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Okay. Bye.  Bye.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.35,0:02:20.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  拜拜  拜
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, Rach, listen. Can you do me a favor?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.99,0:02:24.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}瑞秋  你能帮我一个忙吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I was talkin' to my sister
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.62,0:02:25.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我之前见过我妹妹
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:27.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and she knows you you work at Ralph Lauren...
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.62,0:02:27.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她知道你在拉夫罗兰工作..
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Forget it. No way.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.04,0:02:28.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}算了  绝对不行
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:30.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I am not sending more Ralph Lauren clothes to prison.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:28.37,0:02:30.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会再把拉夫罗兰的衣服寄到监狱
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:33.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} It is a waste.  No, not her.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.74,0:02:33.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那是在暴珍天物  不  不是她
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:37.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My youngest sister, Dina, she is interested in fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.53,0:02:37.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我最小的妹妹蒂娜对流行服装很有兴趣
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:40.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She wants to talk to someone successful to give her some advice.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.07,0:02:40.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她想跟成功人士谈谈  给她一些建议
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I guess I could talk to my supervisors.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.71,0:02:42.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想我可以跟我的上司谈一谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, she wants to talk to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.33,0:02:44.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  她想跟你谈
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:49.41,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Really? Oh, my God. I'm successful.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:44.81,0:02:49.41,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的吗  天啊  我是成功人士
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, so would you meet with her?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:50.35,0:02:51.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能跟她见个面吗
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, I'd love to. Have her come by the office.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.59,0:02:53.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我很乐意  请她来找我吧
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.69,0:02:55.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Great, thanks. You'll love her so much.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:53.69,0:02:55.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  你会喜欢她的
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:58.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She's the smartest of all the Tribbiani children.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.35,0:02:58.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她是崔比安尼家最聪明的孩子
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Yeah, you know the SATs?  Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.78,0:03:00.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道学术评量测验吗  知道
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:01.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}She took them.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.21,0:03:01.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她有考过
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:07.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross, doesn't Ben go to Smithfield Day School?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.93,0:03:07.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯  本念的是史密斯菲德小学吧
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:08.18,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. Why?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:07.34,0:03:08.18,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  怎么了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sting has a son that goes there too.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.18,0:03:10.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史汀的儿子也在那里念书
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know. He's in Ben's class.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.00,0:03:11.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道  他跟本是同班同学
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You knew and never said anything?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.59,0:03:13.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你知道却一直没有告诉我们
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:16.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}With all the stupid dinosaur stuff you tell us?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.60,0:03:16.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}只知道跟我们说那些笨恐龙的事情
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.59,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine, no more dinosaur stuff.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.04,0:03:20.59,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我不会再说恐龙的事了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:22.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can I talk about fossils?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.99,0:03:22.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我能谈谈化石吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:32.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"Sting's son, 7 years old." And there's a picture.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:28.94,0:03:32.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"史汀七岁大的儿子"  还有他的照片
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What are you reading,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.22,0:03:33.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你在看什么
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:35.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}"The Kidnapper's Guide to Manattan Private Schools"?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.01,0:03:35.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"曼哈顿私立学校学童绑架指南"
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.81,0:03:38.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's New York Magazine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.81,0:03:38.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在看《纽约杂志》
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's an article about best schools in the city.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.32,0:03:40.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}报导城里最棒的学校
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:43.11,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So how well do you know Sting?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.85,0:03:43.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你跟史汀很熟吗
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.21,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I actually haven't even met him.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.11,0:03:45.21,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我没有见过他
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.29,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. That's too bad.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.21,0:03:46.29,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那真的很糟糕
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I really wanna go to his concert Friday night,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:46.29,0:03:48.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我真的很想去听他星期五的演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but it's totally sold out.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.13,0:03:50.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但票卖完了
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:54.39,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I know! Why don't you meet him and get tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.15,0:03:54.39,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道了  你为什么不去跟他要票
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:56.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}If you get two, I'll take you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.39,0:03:56.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果你可以要到两张  我就带你去
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Actually, I'm picking Ben up tomorrow. Maybe he'll be there.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.31,0:03:59.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天我会去接本  或许他会在那里
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.34,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There you go. You're so lucky.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:59.96,0:04:02.34,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这就对了  你真是幸运
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.70,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You might get to meet Sting tomorrow.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.34,0:04:04.70,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}明天你可能就会看到史汀了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:07.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That's why you have kids.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.70,0:04:07.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}生小孩就是好处多啊
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:15.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hey, guys.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.22,0:04:15.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  大伙们
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:19.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Monica. Hi, boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.49,0:04:19.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}嗨  莫妮卡  嗨  靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}See, Chandler?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.52,0:04:21.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧  钱德勒
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:23.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm getting a lot of use out of them already.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:21.44,0:04:23.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经开始经常穿了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:24.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}They're very practical.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.28,0:04:24.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}真的很实用
Dialogue: 0,0:04:24.79,0:04:27.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You can wear them with dresses, with skirts, with pants...
