Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.02,0:04:42.77,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定很讨厌脚  想要看着它们死掉
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.16,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Give them to me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.61,0:04:45.16,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把它们送给我
