Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't. I spent so much money on them
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.94,0:04:49.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不行  我花了大价钱买下来
