Dialogue: 0,0:04:49.48,0:04:51.49,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我告诉钱德勒我会一直穿着
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:52.86,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't just give them away.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.49,0:04:52.86,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能送人
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then get your money back and return them.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.86,0:04:55.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你可以拿去退货换钱
