Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.02,0:04:56.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也不能那么做
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The soles are already a little scuffed up,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:56.17,0:04:58.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}鞋底的地方有磨损
