Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.00,0:05:28.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}本的妈妈们是女同志
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:32.01,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wait, Ross. If they don't get along,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.92,0:05:32.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  如果他们处不好
