Dialogue: 0,0:05:41.71,0:05:45.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}游戏床  本都七岁了  七岁了
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.64,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He's really small.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.81,0:05:48.64,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他个头好小哦
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.07,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Please get the tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.52,0:05:52.07,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}拜托你去要门票
