Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.07,0:05:54.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  菲比  我办不到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:57.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yes, you can. Sting says so himself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.51,0:05:57.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  你可以  史汀亲口说过
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What?  Ross can.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:57.48,0:06:00.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}什么  罗斯可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:05.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I'm sorry...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.89,0:06:05.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  我很抱歉
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:08.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Ross can.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.12,0:06:08.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯可以
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.98,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Phoebe?  Ross can get me the tickets.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.36,0:06:13.98,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}菲比  罗斯可以帮我要到门票
