Dialogue: 0,0:06:13.98,0:06:17.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}罗斯可以帮我要到门票
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:25.94,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Here she is: Future fashion superstar.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:23.07,0:06:25.94,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}她来了  未来的流行界超级巨星
