Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.24,0:06:32.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒂娜  很高兴见到你  嗨
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thanks so much for meeting with me.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.63,0:06:34.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢你答应见我
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:36.08,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey's told me so much about you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:34.17,0:06:36.08,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊告诉我很多关于你的事
