Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.68,0:06:42.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}坐下来好好谈正事
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:47.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. All right, Dina.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:44.26,0:06:47.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:50.05,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, let's talk about the different areas of fashion...
Dialogue: 0,0:06:47.06,0:06:50.05,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们来谈谈  你可以考虑的
