Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.05,0:06:52.10,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}服装界的不同领域
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.62,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Let's see, there's design.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:52.99,0:06:54.62,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}让我看看  有设计部门
