Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.62,0:06:57.11,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但那得需要相关文凭
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}There's sales which is great, because you get to travel.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:57.37,0:07:00.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}销售部门不错  你可以旅行
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't care about fashion.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:00.23,0:07:01.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不在乎流行服装
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm pregnant. And I know you are too, so you gotta help me.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:01.71,0:07:05.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我怀孕了  我知道你也是  你得帮帮我
