Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.85,0:07:09.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}还有行销部门
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:36.23,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} What's wrong?  Nothing. I just was yawning.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.94,0:07:36.23,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}怎么了  没事  我只是在打哈欠
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:41.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't forget, my office holiday party's tonight.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:38.65,0:07:41.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}别忘了今晚我公司要办派对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, we don't really have to go to this thing, do we?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:41.60,0:07:43.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们今晚不一定要去  对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.83,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sweetie, I know that you don't like my office parties,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.06,0:07:46.83,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道你不喜欢参加我公司的派对
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but you can wear your new boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.83,0:07:48.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但你可以穿你的新靴子
