Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.95,0:07:54.01,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}看吧  每件事都有它好的一面
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.61,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} I don't wanna wear the boots tonight.  Why not?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.25,0:07:58.61,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}今晚我不想穿靴子  为什么
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.90,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, you know. I'm worried your bosses will see them
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.61,0:08:00.90,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我担心你老板看到以后
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:03.03,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and think they pay you too much money.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.90,0:08:03.03,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}会觉得他们给你的薪水太高了
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:06.89,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Or your assistant will see them and want a raise.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.15,0:08:06.89,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}或是你的助理看到以后会要求加薪
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:10.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you think I work some kind of bootpricing company?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:07.87,0:08:10.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你以为我是在帮靴子订价的公司上班吗
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I picked out this outfit I wanna wear,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:11.85,0:08:13.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我已经挑好了我要穿的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and the boots don't go with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.28,0:08:14.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}靴子跟它不配
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.56,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You said that you paid all that money
Dialogue: 0,0:08:14.97,0:08:16.56,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你说过这双靴子物有所值
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}because those boots go with skirts, dresses, and pants!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:16.56,0:08:20.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}因为可以搭配短裙  连衣裙跟长裤
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Fine. If you want me to, I'll wear the boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:20.09,0:08:22.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  你要我穿靴子我就穿嘛
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:26.51,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}In fact, I'll go into my room right now and try the outfit on.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.96,0:08:26.51,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}事实上我要到卧室去试穿我的衣服
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Christmas party in my boots!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.24,0:08:34.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}穿着我的靴子参加圣诞节派对
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:43.12,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can't go in there. I can't tell him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.31,0:08:43.12,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不能进去  我不敢告诉他
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.46,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}It's gonna be okay.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:43.12,0:08:44.46,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}一定会没事的
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}He has been incredibly supportive of me.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.46,0:08:47.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他一直都非常支持我
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}And if he gets a little upset,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.27,0:08:49.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}如果他大发脾气
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:51.22,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}that's what the meatball sub is for.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.17,0:08:51.22,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}快把肉饼赛百味三明治拿给他
