Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, God.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:31.59,0:13:32.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:39.69,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Honey, I know you're in pain right now,
Dialogue: 0,0:13:38.04,0:13:39.69,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  我知道你很痛
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}but I'm a little turnedon.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:40.32,0:13:42.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我却来了性致
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:48.88,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Do you ever worry that you'll be walking
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.94,0:13:48.88,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你会不会担心走路的时候
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.19,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and your baby will just slip out?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:48.88,0:13:51.19,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}宝宝会掉出来
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What college was that, Dina?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.02,0:13:55.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你念的哪所大学  蒂娜
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:00.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, my God. Bobby?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.35,0:14:00.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}天啊  巴比
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:04.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hi, Dina. Good to see you.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:01.14,0:14:04.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}蒂娜  很高兴能见到你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.17,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, what are you doing?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:04.86,0:14:06.17,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  你在做什么
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:08.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just what needs to be done.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:06.17,0:14:08.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我只是在做我该做的事
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:12.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Dearly beloved, we're gathered here...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:09.69,0:14:12.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的亲友们  我们齐聚一堂
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Joey, this is crazy.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:12.48,0:14:14.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}乔伊  这太疯狂了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Don't interrupt me when I'm talking to God!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:14.04,0:14:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在跟上帝说话  别打断我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Where were we?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:17.62,0:14:18.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我们说到哪里了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} Right, okay. Do you Dina take this man...?  No!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:18.52,0:14:21.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你  蒂娜  愿意嫁这个人...  不
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:23.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You'll take him.  No, I won't!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:21.47,0:14:23.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你得嫁他  不  我不会嫁
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.66,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)} You don't get a say in this.  Yes, I do.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:23.30,0:14:25.66,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这可由不得你  不  我就愿意这样
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.42,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I heard "I do." We're halfway there.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:25.66,0:14:27.42,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我听到了"我愿意"  已经完成一半
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.02,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. You.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.42,0:14:29.02,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}再来是你
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}All right, Joey, that is enough!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:29.09,0:14:31.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  乔伊  够了
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Listen. As beautiful and moving as this ceremony is,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:31.28,0:14:33.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}虽然这个婚礼既漂亮又温馨
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}this is not legal.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:33.58,0:14:34.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这是不合法的
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.72,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. They don't have a marriage license
Dialogue: 0,0:14:34.87,0:14:36.72,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们没有结婚证书
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.74,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and they don't have any witnesses,
Dialogue: 0,0:14:36.72,0:14:38.74,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}也没有证婚人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and the groom only has one shoe.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:39.32,0:14:41.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}而且新郎只穿了一只鞋
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah, he took the other one off and hit me with it.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.60,0:14:44.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  他把另一只鞋脱了  用来打我
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.13,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}What am I supposed to do?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.88,0:14:47.13,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我该怎么办
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:49.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}You're supposed to realize they are adults
Dialogue: 0,0:14:47.13,0:14:49.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你应该了解他们是成年人
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.47,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and that can make their own decisions.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.45,0:14:51.47,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}可以自己做决定
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:54.71,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, they can't. They were stupid enough to get knocked up!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:51.47,0:14:54.71,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  他们不能  他们笨到让自己怀孕
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:15:01.04,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Contraceptives are not always effective. Right?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:57.01,0:15:01.04,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}预防措施不一定有效对吧
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:04.50,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Yeah. We kind of didn't use any.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:01.54,0:15:04.50,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对  我们没有做预防措施
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, kids, a little help here!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:04.50,0:15:06.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}孩子们  别帮倒忙了
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Wow! This place is incredible!
Dialogue: 0,0:15:12.10,0:15:14.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这个地方真的很棒
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.58,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Sting's pen...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.83,0:15:19.58,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}史汀的笔...
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...that he gave to Phoebe.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.36,0:15:22.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他送给了菲比
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:31.06,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Come on, secret passageway.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:27.82,0:15:31.06,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}来吧  秘密通道
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:38.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm Trudie. You must be Ben's mum.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:35.91,0:15:38.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我是楚蒂  你一定是本的妈妈
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why else would I be here?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:39.12,0:15:40.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不然我为什么要到这里来呢
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.09,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you sit down.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:41.69,0:15:43.09,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}请坐
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:46.45,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I gather Jack and Ben haven't been getting along lately.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:43.55,0:15:46.45,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我知道杰克跟本最近处得不太好
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sure there are two sides to this story.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:47.25,0:15:49.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我相信这个故事一定有两面说法
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:52.85,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}But all I've heard is that Ben's a bit of a "poopoohead."
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.20,0:15:52.85,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}但我听到的是本是个"大笨蛋"
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:56.68,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry, won't Jack's father be joining us?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:53.69,0:15:56.68,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  杰克的爸爸不会来吗
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.20,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Well, I'm sorry. Jack's father's not available.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:56.68,0:15:59.20,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}对不起  杰克的爸爸没空
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:03.79,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. Well, then, could we reschedule for Friday night,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:00.40,0:16:03.79,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  我们可以改约到周五晚上
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:05.33,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}perhaps at 8:00?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:03.79,0:16:05.33,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}八点见行吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.81,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}No, I know that wouldn't work.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:05.33,0:16:06.81,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}不  那样行不通
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:08.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My husband's in concert.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:06.81,0:16:08.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我丈夫要办演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.96,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Concert. Yeah.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:08.00,0:16:09.96,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演唱会
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.87,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}That does put us in quite a pickle.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:10.96,0:16:13.87,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}这让问题变得有点棘手
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:17.30,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Because you see I'm busy before and after the concert,
Dialogue: 0,0:16:14.42,0:16:17.30,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演唱会前后我都有事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}and he's obviously busy during.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:17.31,0:16:19.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}演唱会的时间他又很忙
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:22.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}So I guess you and I should talk about Jack and Ben right now.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:19.26,0:16:22.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我想你跟我现在该来谈谈杰克跟本的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Unless... Unless...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:23.12,0:16:25.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}除非...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:29.60,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I would be willing to go to the concert...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:26.37,0:16:29.60,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我愿意到演唱会上...
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:33.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}...all the while thinking about the children, of course.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:30.24,0:16:33.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}想一想孩子们的事
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.82,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Are you here for tickets?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:33.94,0:16:35.82,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你是来要票的吗
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:38.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Thank you. Four would be great.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:36.17,0:16:38.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}谢谢  四张就够了
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:40.63,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm not giving concert tickets
Dialogue: 0,0:16:39.01,0:16:40.63,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我不会把演唱会门票
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.40,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}to someone who'd use their son like this.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:40.63,0:16:43.40,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}送给这样利用自己孩子的人
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.31,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Then you're in luck. Ben's not my son.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:43.40,0:16:46.31,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}那正好  本不是我的儿子
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.78,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Look, I've just pressed a button triggering a silent alarm.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:47.63,0:16:50.78,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}听着  我已经按下了静声警铃
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.97,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Any minute now, the police will be here.
Dialogue: 0,0:16:50.78,0:16:52.97,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}警察随时会到
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.00,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}The Police? Here?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:52.97,0:16:55.00,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}"警察乐队"要来？
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.92,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}A reunion?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:55.27,0:16:56.92,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}他们要复合了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:08.52,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, 10 blocks down. Five to go.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.69,0:17:08.52,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  已经走了十条街  只剩五条
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.76,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, wait! Stop, stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:09.02,0:17:10.76,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}等一下  停
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:13.24,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Oh, I'm sorry. Do you need a break?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:10.77,0:17:13.24,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  你需要休息吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.44,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}My boots in tan!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:14.98,0:17:16.44,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}是棕黄色的同款靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.38,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Can you get a little closer so I see the price?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:16.44,0:17:18.38,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你能靠近一点  让我看看价钱吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:22.32,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I can see it from right here. It'll cost you one husband.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:18.38,0:17:22.32,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我在这里就看到了 它会害你丢掉一个老公
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I'm sorry. I can walk the rest of the way now.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:23.22,0:17:25.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}抱歉  我可以自己走了
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.28,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Just give me my boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:25.53,0:17:27.28,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}把我的靴子还给我
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.53,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have your boots.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:28.73,0:17:30.53,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我没有拿你的靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.48,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}I don't have them either. Where are they?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:30.53,0:17:32.48,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我也没拿  那在哪里
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.35,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Why don't you check in one of my saddlebags
Dialogue: 0,0:17:32.48,0:17:34.35,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}你为什么不去看看鞍囊里有没有
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:37.26,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}while I chew on a bale of hay?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:34.35,0:17:37.26,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}我先去吃点草
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.95,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay. My God, we gotta go back and get them!
Dialogue: 0,0:17:38.47,0:17:41.95,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}好吧  天啊  我们得回去找靴子
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:45.37,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Hoeny, are you ever gonna wear the boots again?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:41.95,0:17:45.37,Chinese,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,1050)}亲爱的  你还会再穿那双靴子吗
Dialogue: 0,0:17:46.05,0:17:47.80,English,,0,0,0,,{\pos(960,990)}Okay, I'll never wear them again.
